<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδαίνω</span>
			, only in part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κραδάων δολιχόσκιον ἔγχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.213
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.438
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξὺ δόρυ κραδάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.583
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				20.423
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of trees,
				<i>suffer from blight</i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κράδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.4
			</span></i>. (Cf. Skt. <i>kū´rdati</i> 'leap',
			Lat. <i>cardo</i> 'that which turns, pivot'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
